  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This standard covers requirements for plain as well as socket-ended pipes, including those for use with elastomeric sealing rings, for potable water supplies. 1.1.1 The standard also cover pipes for agricultural use. 1.2 This standard does not cover unplasticized PVC pipes for use in suction and delivery lines of agricultural pumps, which have been covered in IS 12231. 1.3 The pipes covered in this standard are not suitable for use as casing pipes in tube wells. Such pipes are covered in IS 12818.",
